{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "56c87e0f8d17b5d0d1ed25b9c6f2b7da905108cd1bf4b74745e361055d7499f6", "ja": "ランニング・ハイッ", "zh": "Running High", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ddb515ab85d8cf69e070e5de7da1a64e3830f20241bc4d2516cb2f9f49b89e8a", "ja": "ランニングライブ当日。ファンの声援を受け\nながらリレーを繋いでいくメンバー達だが、\n最終走者のエミリーは靴ずれの影響もあって\n止まってしまう。しかし仲間の声援を受け無\n事完走、全員でライブへ向かうのだった。", "zh": "Running演唱会当天，\n成员们在粉丝的加油声中进行大队接力，\n然而最后一棒的艾蜜莉却因为脚磨破的影响，\n跑到一半停了下来。但在伙伴的声援之下，\n艾蜜莉顺利跑完全程，众人一起前往演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "087cce876d07fe1079acd02369bac2b0736a40c22dfedc147bf53fa0c1eb0f05", "ja": "（いよいよ、奈緒達のランニングライブ当日だ！\nトラブルなく走り切れるといいんだが……）", "zh": "（终于来到奈绪她们的Running演唱会当天了！\n希望不要发生状况，可以顺利跑完……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "a5d69e065099107b00d09d54f0485034c863233fb098eec90af54f6bdd2a26e9", "ja": "お客さん、たくさん来てくれたねぇ。\n劇場だけじゃなくて、コース沿いにも！", "zh": "来了好多观众哪。\n不只剧场，连路线两侧也都是人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "0eb8139dadaeb2f47b6f49f789359c26c3dcdd9db411c76bc8f6c65e29dda31f", "ja": "せやな！　なんや、いつものライブとは\n違ったうれしさがあるわぁ♪", "zh": "就是啊！\n有一种不同于平时演唱会的喜悦呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "b138bb0bdf782cd3b97074ca244923f32ec680c8fa03f4183d77cc7ff2d04c6d", "ja": "こんなに応援していただけるなんて……。\nごヒイキ様方の期待は、絶対に裏切れませんね！", "zh": "居然能得到这么多声援……\n绝对不能辜负各位主顾的期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2bbaef4e461c745acbedb18c1ef66103a17ce371770dcbc9ab5af8c3ca9cf4e3", "ja": "みんな、気合いは十分だな。リレー形式で繋ぐ、\nランニング……段取りの方は問題ないか？", "zh": "大家都很有干劲啊。\n交棒接力跑步……大家都清楚流程了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "2fd12e68d885bdef89f3ab2715aeb86c7ee1cf21b83d3ee8d37f15e7e5ea867d", "ja": "うん、最初の走者はあたしだねぇ。\n最初はちょっと緊張するけど、がんばるべさ！", "zh": "嗯，第一棒是我。\n虽然当第一个有点紧张，但我会加油哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "f9fd99c8c79c0365b5d297cf832fd5ba22c679e3c2941586b945260ba4b0f628", "ja": "その次が私です。\n熱い走り、ファンのみんなに見せますよ！", "zh": "下一棒是我。\n我会让各位粉丝看到我炙热的奔跑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "476e34dc2fd354f017550037fcc5cd1231d2dca13fddb779114cd85507fdb01b", "ja": "最後は私が走って劇場へ。\nそして、3人で公演をするという流れですね。", "zh": "最后一棒会由我一路跑到剧场，\n接着三个人一起进行公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "246d9627e68eb7d01b5c3e65557e427cf49985e2a400151f035ef0fa075aa30e", "ja": "よし、それじゃ各々配置につこう。\n真夏のランニングライブ、必ず成功させよう！", "zh": "好，那大家各就各位吧。\n一定要让盛夏的Running演唱会成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "9954aa2064edd75cd72405fa355a4c766dd1b13ddb595ecb8d0e3c9fb49204bb", "ja": "みんな、今日はあたしたちを応援しに来てくれて、\nありがとさんです。がんばるから、よろしくねぇ。", "zh": "谢谢大家今天来帮我们加油打气。\n我们会努力的，拜托大家哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1013_audience", "source_sha256": "107a85949915b47ac460ec92836062b1fe2277c8241fd688a7810b2321de8625", "ja": "ウオオオー！", "zh": "喔喔喔喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c2c62c4067f551bd3fc8baddf9086e08410a79123c02d69f33494a0290780eef", "ja": "それじゃあ、開始の合図を鳴らすぞ。\n位置について……よーい、ドン！", "zh": "那么，我要喊起跑的口号啰。\n各就各位……预备～开跑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "d15db6f25b12a651df70c8d6faace668fa29006418a53a7648eb41c03b6a1ebb", "ja": "行くべさっ！", "zh": "我出发了哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2c6f049ff4b21c556bbdcbb1579dbb9cd5d623a4450d449119ff12da073371cf", "ja": "（さすがはひなた、出だしはばっちりだ。この間に、\n俺は車で奈緒との中継ポイントに向かわないと！）", "zh": "（不愧是日向，完美起跑。\n我得趁这段时间开车去她跟奈绪交棒的中继点！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "0ebf58acde7fead9978002ee45a10f307d515cef82d4f8cf8240c45cbf3dcab1", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nひなたの様子、どんな感じです？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n日向的情况怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "798ea2a3bed7aa5e0227b8e5a071b7e13b618c0519b63fc1dbb3a474bd214ab3", "ja": "映像を見る限り、順調だよ。想定より速いくらいで……\nおっ、噂をすれば、ひなたが見えてきたぞ！", "zh": "从画面来看是挺顺利的，甚至比预估速度还快……\n哦，才刚说完，已经可以看到日向了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "300d0619302cf5b250c5739060a81f3b96426fdd58d3bae1105950a59ae015e9", "ja": "あっ、ひなたー！\nあとちょっとや！　がんばりやー！", "zh": "啊，日向──！\n快到啦！加油啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "81b310e77dad48ec7a4b13ecec8d504ab5eb9e13af4ca64ff8488bfdd5ff7ce7", "ja": "負けないっしょや！　はあ、はあ……こ、ここまでで\n大丈夫かい……？　奈緒さん、頼んだよぉ。", "zh": "我不会输的！呼、呼……\n到、到这边就可以了吗……？奈绪，拜托你了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "45c35700672ac43d87312b0d10805d215a2c66485c8158740ccb5dc3f76e3d79", "ja": "よっしゃ！　まかしときっ！\n絶対、エミリーに繋げてみせるわ！！", "zh": "好！包在我身上！\n我一定会交棒给艾蜜莉的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "263fe6f4ea41c2c6b29447bec79c4b1a8108d2b31db2bd06c871f85543b04423", "ja": "みんな！　応援のほう、よろしく頼みます！\n行っくで～……！　関西の星ダーッシュ！！", "zh": "大家！拜托你们帮我加油！\n我要上啦……！关西之星冲刺──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1023_audience", "source_sha256": "107a85949915b47ac460ec92836062b1fe2277c8241fd688a7810b2321de8625", "ja": "ウオオオー！", "zh": "喔喔喔喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "f8a3bcd3e50138f2fbf57dfc688646084ac10cc1b13a82407dc2fa529bfa4544", "ja": "元気のいいスタートダッシュだけど、\n奈緒、あのペースで大丈夫か……？", "zh": "奈绪活力十足地冲出去了，\n不过，她那个步调没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b16a14d52aba6ea4e5d538327b1c7a87972ef33afbb5447b757d16ebab0383ef", "ja": "（いや、ここまで来たらみんなを信じるだけだ。\n次は、エミリーとの中継ポイントに急ごう！）", "zh": "（不，都到这个关头了，我只须相信大家。\n接下来要赶往跟艾蜜莉交棒的中继点！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "e1bf74ee1253e1cfeb73adf067d9462df0f4bb28d988a9fda58b20c262a7611d", "ja": "ぜえ、はあ……！　ぜ、前半飛ばしすぎた……！\nでも……あと、もうちょっと！", "zh": "呼、呼……！前、前半段冲得太快了……！\n不过……还差一点就到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "b62a7bf106f2c0f44daea940a5b165386098e610208fcee86d9dd1d07863f069", "ja": "ラストスパートっ！　ぜえ、はあ……\nエミリー！　あとはまかせたでー！", "zh": "最后冲刺！呼、呼……\n艾蜜莉！后面交给你啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "33ba55fc805b22f64fabb95bab2f11c79d4cc56094273dbf0315db14c9be551a", "ja": "奈緒、よく頑張ったな！\nエミリー、アンカー頼んだぞ！", "zh": "奈绪，你做得很棒！\n艾蜜莉，最后一棒拜托啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "06e50f7c31be771764a4bd54807740060b107c8c5a5ef2f335c4b4af2664d8ff", "ja": "はいっ！　最終走者として、\n必ず劇場に到着してみせます……っ！", "zh": "是！身为最后一棒跑者，\n我一定会抵达剧场的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "4939cbb59ecf61f744ed04159377500973289a2f30533f821d2cfe6117e22a77", "ja": "ごヒイキ様方、どうぞ私に力を……！　大和撫子魂を、\n走りに込めますっ！！　はああーーーっ！", "zh": "各位主顾，请你们给我力量……！\n我要将大和抚子精神灌注到跑步上！！喝啊啊────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "df8c6ee7a7809eacf4406875115e3b7f12cb450efccb7a4dc52c1ffc88dd1190", "ja": "（エミリーもハイペースだな……。本番の熱気で、\nいつもよりテンションが高くなっているのか）", "zh": "（艾蜜莉的速度也很快呢……是正式上场的热烈气氛，\n让她的情绪比平时更高昂了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "169f69be77d6e7de3e148f9f246fc3991e1dbc1897b449f21bd6b56185db5e90", "ja": "（ペース配分、崩さなければいいんだが……）", "zh": "（希望她的配速不要乱掉才好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1033_032emi", "source_sha256": "07b3175d1fb854e3961af4ed64fdd3d0e458f5f904d4187d1a2e30c6bdab3db4", "ja": "ぜえ、はあ……。\n思ったより、消耗が……。", "zh": "呼、呼……\n体力消耗得比想像中快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "460b19fa823e84a2581d4c966270e58164a3b7fbf8c6eba09f385d98bf505ee0", "ja": "でも……おふたりが……ごヒイキ様方が、\n待っているんです……。仕掛け人さまも……。", "zh": "可是……她们两位……各位主顾，\n都在等我……还有策划执行人先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "b330f15246905d173798492bd602c7b30f1bc50ce8ab23726bf6f400922772a6", "ja": "や、大和撫子、魂……っ！", "zh": "大、大和抚子精神……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1036_p", "source_sha256": "14f446d83b52c4b9c8ef9683217d83daa72e1e6b1fd7a5ce39f958ea8eedf32d", "ja": "（予想が当たってしまった……エミリーのペースが、\n目に見えて落ちていって……）", "zh": "（被我料中了……\n艾蜜莉的步调很明显慢了下来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1037_p", "source_sha256": "e0be7001967e5872a8ad95987ca10cc7e9fb4733846968e0ac79b3777103e8b3", "ja": "（ついに、立ち止まってしまった……）", "zh": "（最后终于停下来了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "26773593b2b81dbeb6b4a1f3369eb59294debd4ebd75f5d50bd7058f545787e9", "ja": "エミリー……！", "zh": "艾蜜莉……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1039_035hin", "source_sha256": "dba3afdcd670ee88cd2af20a44711b1dfca63c18c2bd91922928e9153394c83f", "ja": "エミリーちゃん……！", "zh": "艾蜜莉……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1040_p", "source_sha256": "5cb10791c1056cd6b551077dad2e4d2c6dba1243b94632429c670f1fa5757544", "ja": "（靴ずれの影響もあるし、ここから巻き返すのは、\n本来なら相当難しい。難しいはず、なんだけど……）", "zh": "（毕竟脚磨破也有影响，要从这里急起直追，\n原本是相当困难的。应该很困难，然而……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1041_032emi", "source_sha256": "fb0902794d6f1fffacf80e08ed952674b45a713aaf5bc162d84fe636eb2f7047", "ja": "前に、進まなくては……\nすこしずつ、ゆっくりでも……終着点まで……。", "zh": "我必须前进……\n一点一点慢慢跑也好……要到终点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1042_037nao", "source_sha256": "a0cc4cfc7f3a1f26c8bca3fef8679847803b75b077eb9a7626dea5199a468230", "ja": "うぅっ！　こうしちゃおられへん！\nそうやんな、ひなた！", "zh": "呜呜！没办法继续在这干等了！\n你说对吧，日向！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1043_035hin", "source_sha256": "130f6bc2c70fb250b9fbe1e0ca3c328307c1e1700328d1bee234900b8ebe16c7", "ja": "奈緒さん……！\nあたしも、おんなじ気持ちだよ！", "zh": "奈绪……！\n我的想法也跟你一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1044_p", "source_sha256": "05dd8eaa70f3d9d7b029aa10b8f601a79b4ede6031d8006d734852535fc0e3b8", "ja": "（ここは信じよう。あのふたりと……疲れても、\nいまだ絶やさない、エミリーの笑顔を！）", "zh": "（这时就相信那两个人吧……\n还有再怎么疲累，笑容都分毫未减的艾蜜莉！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1045_037nao", "source_sha256": "c09ec123fb86384eff43c86606a38a4a3a4dc7349ebe7b1ceb380fdea616b8b7", "ja": "エミリー！（エミリーちゃん！）", "zh": "艾蜜莉！（艾蜜莉！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1046_035hin", "source_sha256": "1f7dcf10f7b3b6532b3508705f127e4a8a83493504a1a0d792e5b7badfe1fdc9", "ja": "エミリーちゃん！", "zh": "艾蜜莉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1047_032emi", "source_sha256": "b0e4e86037c0d5315dd2cc1e5dd1d0064f98d813565e7ca12564303e8096580e", "ja": "お、おふたりとも！？\nどうしてここに……！", "zh": "你、你们两位！？\n怎么会在这里……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1048_037nao", "source_sha256": "79ae071549b4ebc21b6d19632e8f0012796808803e0a13d32e371928c33cb054", "ja": "どうしてって、そんなん決まってるやん！\n一緒に走るためや！", "zh": "那还用说吗！\n当然是来跟你一起跑的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1049_035hin", "source_sha256": "4f4864e908dcb4235e980ac2de553f91395f036b4e0534561baf0353b256bda1", "ja": "エミリーちゃんの走りを見てたら、\nなんだか体が動いてきてしまったんだべさ。", "zh": "看着艾蜜莉跑步，\n我的身体就忍不住自己动起来了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1050_035hin", "source_sha256": "a61a73936b0cc9aade86efedc1b88e017d13665d7044bf9f815d5c68d652c5db", "ja": "ペースはゆっくりだけども……\nエミリーちゃん、なまら楽しそうだったからねぇ。", "zh": "虽然步调比较慢……\n但是艾蜜莉看起来特开心哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1051_037nao", "source_sha256": "a9b8cd557bfed19583345724d31e6aba98b653d41106b23b7a8ea2134c7b7e70", "ja": "エミリーだけ、楽しいのはなしやで！\n私らも、仲間にいれてもらわんとな！", "zh": "不能只有艾蜜莉一个人开心啦！\n也要让我们加入才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1052_032emi", "source_sha256": "ed6a2e23d582198981e6a2e7efdee9a058ed075605b67c2ac3c2af536f10d527", "ja": "ふふ……ふふふ……！\nまさか、おふたりも同じ気持ちだったなんて。", "zh": "呵呵……呵呵呵……！\n没想到两位的想法居然跟我一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1053_032emi", "source_sha256": "1174491491ca203e549300a3d73439dd2abe049b665288b8cf568855b69c6dbc", "ja": "私も、ここからが本番だと思っていたところです。\n今までにないくらいの、高揚です！", "zh": "我刚刚也正好在想，现在开始才是重头戏呢。\n情绪前所未有的激昂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1054_037nao", "source_sha256": "c850f5f2452c3326f282f89c314a951cf36bd6c7c5c9795989bbd01edd504253", "ja": "よっしゃ！　それなら、\nもうあとは一直線に目指すだけや！", "zh": "好！\n那接下来就只剩直奔终点了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1055_035hin", "source_sha256": "38ab7d594424c68d85da9b22025becfde3bb9197d2a51d98ec3c6c93098ef698", "ja": "そうだねぇ。ファンのみんなが、\nあたしたちを待ってるべさ！", "zh": "没错，粉丝们都在等我们哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1056_032emi", "source_sha256": "6706d7e01f21a4838c5603fef4edb30f7c6694b241445fac702b7f70ed1a1bd3", "ja": "はい！　ではおふたりとも……いざ、参りましょう！\nここからは、全力疾走です！", "zh": "好的！那么两位……我们上吧！\n接下来要全力冲刺！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1057_037nao", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1058_035hin", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1059_audience", "source_sha256": "46df5dc05f5e237d9eb1e73ac8b96c462c82bcc481fa26ca790207e8add5eb8c", "ja": "ウオオオオオオオオオオー！！", "zh": "喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1060_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1061_p", "source_sha256": "6c15002b232f820a6d24222566d6a35e0f29d40a245664b3ba9c97e1c0f3ec80", "ja": "みんな、よく頑張った！\nこのままライブだが……いけるか！？", "zh": "大家表现得很棒！\n就这样直接开始演唱会……可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1062_032emi", "source_sha256": "bf021ae3137fb7c5296ff32d106a1eb3bc73448772831e22db5abe6bd0868988", "ja": "はあ、はあ……はい！　もちろんです！", "zh": "呼、呼……可以！当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1063_037nao", "source_sha256": "43b5464698c6123c056007c48da9ea28f0bf783dbe4f7e0efe11adf7a7e7f348", "ja": "ここで止まれっていうほうが無理ですよ！\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "叫我们在这停下还比较强人所难啦！\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1064_035hin", "source_sha256": "44e5063b8b1588c9d0504c1d7b1ccf564c1cf628be64c5d4822861e97b340b95", "ja": "この熱さ、そのまま観客席のお客さんに\n届けてみせるよぉ！", "zh": "我们要把这股热情\n直接传递给台下的观众们～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0096_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_06_1065_p", "source_sha256": "af307efdc4f9d18e7acc9ee80d68cc32e925f1935034bf294c7fb120c410852a", "ja": "よし、分かった。今のエネルギー、\n思いっきりライブにぶつけてきてくれ！", "zh": "好，我明白了。大家尽情地将现在这股能量\n挥洒到演唱会上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
